            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Moon 0.4.20 beta

- Ask Moon a question or follow up with Gemini below the new-tab address field. Add your Gemini API key in Settings → AI.
- The sidebar keeps its space pager and clears the mini dock. Find Translation and Extensions in View, and Orbit in History.
- The Codex workspace and its local helper have been removed.

Apple silicon, macOS 26 or later. One signed DMG serves installation and in-app updates. This Moon beta is Apple Development signed and is not Apple-notarized.
]]></description>
